** Yes\n**If this was caught during regression testing, add the test name, ID and link from BrowserStack:** https://test-management.browserstack.com/projects/2219752/test-runs/TR-17114/folder/13176677/41237662/1317002015\n**Email or phone of affected tester (no customers):** lekima20+642404@gmail.com\n**Issue reported by:** Applause Internal Team\n**Bug source:** Regression TC Execution\n**Device used:** Win 11/Chrome\n**App Component:** Other\n\n## Action Performed:\n1. Open https://staging.new.expensify.com\n2. Create a new user with select option \"Manage my team's expenses\" and complete flow\n3. Navigate to Concierge chat\n4. Click on 'categories\" at the task 'Set up categories and tags'\n5. Add a category\n6. Click on More features and enable Tags\n7. Click on Tags tab and add some tags\n8. Navigate to Concierge chat\n9. Refresh page\n10. Click on the task 'Set up categories and tags'\n\n## Expected Result:\nThe task 'Set up categories and tags' should get auto-checked\n\n## Actual Result:\nThe task 'Set up categories and tags’ isn't auto-checked\n\n## Workaround:\nUnknown\n\n## Platforms:\n- [x] Android: App\n- [ ] Android: mWeb Chrome\n- [x] iOS: App\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Safari\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Chrome\n- [x] Windows: Chrome\n- [ ] MacOS: Chrome / Safari\n\n## Screenshots/Videos\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/277219f7-03dc-48ae-ba91-8ceffd58b9b6\n\n[View all open jobs on GitHub](https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3A%22Help+Wanted%22)\n\n\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022042198222552145991</li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2042198222552145991</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-04-16</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>\n\n<details><summary>Issue Owner</summary>Current Issue Owner: @nkdengineer</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/87482/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0