github.com/users/truph01/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/truph01/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/truph01/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"If you haven’t already, check out our [contributing guidelines](https://github.com/Expensify/ReactNativeChat/blob/main/contributingGuides/CONTRIBUTING.md) for onboarding. To join our Slack channel, fill out [this form](https://forms.gle/Q7hnhUJPnQCK7Fe56).\n___\n\n**Version Number:** v9.4.6-0\n**Reproducible in staging?:** Yes\n**Reproducible in production?:** Yes\n**If this was caught during regression testing, add the test name, ID and link from BrowserStack:** https://test-management.browserstack.com/projects/2219752/folder/30823848/test-cases/72255457?q=Offline+Modification+and+Exported+Column+Behavior\n\n## Action Performed:\n\n1. Navigate to Spend > Reports and enable the Exported column via the Edit column selector\n2. Verify Exported column dispalyed\n3. Click Edit Columns, disable the Exported column, and click Save\n4. Verify the \"Exported\" column cells not displayed in the table\n5. Enter a search term in the report search bar to filter reports\n6. Disconnect the device from the internet (Go offline)\n7. Click on the \"Columns\" button again\n8. Re-check/Enable the \"Exported\" column checkbox\n\n\n## Expected Result:\nExported column should be added to the table\n\n## Actual Result:\nPage goes blank with an error message You appear to be offline\n\n## Workaround:\nUnknown\n\n## Platforms:\nSelect the officially supported platforms where the issue was reproduced:\n- [ ] Android: App\n- [ ] Android: mWeb Chrome\n- [ ] iOS: App\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Safari\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Chrome\n- [x] Windows: Chrome\n- [ ] MacOS: Chrome / Safari\n\n## Screenshots/Videos\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/42b954eb-5c59-477e-8ca6-62e80d3fb9b4\n\n[View all open jobs on GitHub](https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3A%22Help+Wanted%22)\n\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: <a href=\"https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022065388064058618518\">https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022065388064058618518</a></li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2065388064058618518</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-07-03</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>\n\n<details><summary>Issue Owner</summary>Current Issue Owner: @lakchote</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/93417/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/93417/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/90544","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/90544/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/90544/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/90544/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues/90544","id":4439750075,"node_id":"I_kwDOEQqHYc8AAAABCKE1uw","number":90544,"title":"[Due for payment 2026-06-25] [$250] Session expired but user was not signed out","user":{"login":"m-natarajan","id":38435837,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NDM1ODM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38435837?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-natarajan","html_url":"https://github.com/m-natarajan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-natarajan/followers","