utors@expensify.com to request to join our Slack channel!\n___\n\n**Version Number:** 9.4.6-0\n**Reproducible in staging?:** Yes\n**Reproducible in production?:** Yes\n**If this was caught during regression testing, add the test name, ID and link from BrowserStack:** EDGE https://github.com/Expensify/Expensify/issues/608024\n**Email or phone of affected tester (no customers):** undefined\n**Issue reported by:** Applause Internal Team\n\n\n## Action Performed:\n1. Open https://staging.new.expensify.com/\n2. Go to workspace settings.\n3. Go to Company cards.\n4. Go to Categories/any other page.\n5. Go to Company cards.\n\n## Expected Result:\nIn Step 5, Company cards page will not load each time opening it.\n\n## Actual Result:\nIn Step 5, Company cards page loads each time opening it.\n\n## Workaround:\nUnknown\n\n## Platforms:\n- [ ] Android: App\n- [ ] Android: mWeb Chrome\n- [ ] iOS: App\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Safari\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Chrome\n- [x] Windows: Chrome\n- [ ] MacOS: Chrome / Safari\n\n## Screenshots/Videos\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5a9630d7-0171-4970-a0d4-47b19aab96a1\n\n[View all open jobs on GitHub](https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3A%22Help+Wanted%22)\n\n\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: <a href=\"https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022065365683893732639\">https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022065365683893732639</a></li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2065365683893732639</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-07-03</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>\n\n<details><summary>Issue Owner</summary>Current Issue Owner: @nkdengineer</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/93404/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/93404/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_