 is broken. Auto assigns a BugZero manager."}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[{"login":"marcaaron","id":32969087,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyOTY5MDg3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32969087?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcaaron","html_url":"https://github.com/marcaaron","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcaaron/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcaaron/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcaaron/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcaaron/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcaaron/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcaaron/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcaaron/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcaaron/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcaaron/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},{"login":"ahmedGaber93","id":41129870,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMTI5ODcw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41129870?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahmedGaber93","html_url":"https://github.com/ahmedGaber93","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahmedGaber93/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahmedGaber93/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahmedGaber93/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahmedGaber93/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahmedGaber93/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahmedGaber93/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahmedGaber93/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahmedGaber93/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahmedGaber93/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},{"login":"KJ21-ENG","id":140263938,"node_id":"U_kgDOCFxCAg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/140263938?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KJ21-ENG","html_url":"https://github.com/KJ21-ENG","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KJ21-ENG/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KJ21-ENG/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KJ21-ENG/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KJ21-ENG/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KJ21-ENG/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KJ21-ENG/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KJ21-ENG/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KJ21-ENG/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KJ21-ENG/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":35,"created_at":"2026-05-14T15:32:23Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T03:10:08Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":{"login":"marcaaron","id":32969087,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyOTY5MDg3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32969087?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcaaron","html_url":"https://github.com/marcaaron","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcaaron/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcaaron/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcaaron/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcaaron/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcaaron/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcaaron/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcaaron/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcaaron/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcaaron/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"If you haven’t already, check out our [contributing guidelines](https://github.com/Expensify/ReactNativeChat/blob/main/contributingGuides/CONTRIBUTING.md) for onboarding and email contributors@expensify.com to request to join our Slack channel!\n___\n\n**Version Number:** v9.3.74-1\n**Reproducible in staging?:** Yes\n**Reproducible in production?:** Yes\n**If this was caught during regression testing, add the test name, ID and link from BrowserStack:** https://github.com/Expensify/App/pull/90528\n**Email or phone of affected tester (no customers):** N/A\n**Issue reported by:** Applause Internal Team\n**Bug source:** Exploratory - Significant User Experience Deterioration\n**Device used:** Windows 11 / Chrome, iPhone 13 / iOS 26.5, Samsung Galaxy A52 / Android 14\n**App Component:** Workspace Settings\n\n## Action Performed:\nPreconditions\n- Logged in to existing gmail account that already add mock bank company cards in workspace but hasn't assigned to that account yet\n\nSteps:\n1. Navigate to company card in workspace\n2. Click add card\n3. Choose any mock bank card\n4. fill the work email field\n5. Click save\n\n## Expected Result:\nClicking \"save\" should respond something like if the work email is valid, user can navigate to the next step. Or if the work email is invalid, there should be an error occurred\n\n## Actual Result:\nNothing happened when attempt to add work email in company card\n\n## Workaround:\nUnknown\n\n## Platforms:\n- [x] Android: App\n- [ ] Android: mWeb Chrome\n- [x] iOS: App\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Safari\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Chrome\n- [x] Windows: Chrome\n- [x] MacOS: Chrome / Safari\n\n## Screenshots/Videos\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1873fbb2-c4bc-455c-8f39-5b62c97af097\n\n[View all open jobs on GitHub](https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3A%22Help+Wanted%22)\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: <a href=\"https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022064688933652170015\">https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022064688933652170015</a></li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2064688933652170015</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-06-17</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>\n\n<details><summary>Issue Owner</summary>Current Issue Owner: @KJ21-ENG</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/90691/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/90691/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/92364","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/92364/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/92364/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/92364/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues/92364","id":4571677482,"node_id":"I_kwDOEQqHYc8AAAABEH5DKg","number":92364,"title":"[$250] Concierge options loads every time when choose an option","user":{"login":"applause-bot[bot]","id":265651874,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOD9WGog","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/3009811?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/applause-bot%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/applause-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/applause-bot%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/applause-bot%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/applause