Reproducible in production?:** Yes\n**If this was caught during regression testing, add the test name, ID and link from BrowserStack:** https://test-management.browserstack.com/projects/2219752/test-runs/TR-32100/folder/13176924/43449388/1432273397?sort=-identifier\n**Email or phone of affected tester (no customers):** soijdnoisdjoijsdionsjio@gmail.com\n**Issue reported by:** Applause Internal Team\n**Bug source:** Exploratory - Significant User Experience Deterioration\n**Device used:** Mac 26.2 / Chrome\n**App Component:** Other\n\n## Action Performed:\n1. Go to staging.new.expensify.com\n2. Create a workspace.\n3. Go to workspace settings > More features.\n4. Enable Rules. \n5. Upgrade workspace to enable Rules.\n6. Go to Rules.\n7. Refresh the page.\n8. Go to Account > Sign out.\n9. Log in with a new Gmail account.\n10. Complete onboarding with Manage my team's expenses intent.\n\n## Expected Result:\nNot here page will not appear after completing onboarding.\n\n## Actual Result:\nNot here page appears briefly after completing onboarding.\n\n## Workaround:\nUnknown\n\n## Platforms:\n- [ ] Android: App\n- [ ] Android: mWeb Chrome\n- [ ] iOS: App\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Safari\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Chrome\n- [x] Windows: Chrome\n- [ ] MacOS: Chrome Safari\n\n## Screenshots/Videos\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f84f82c6-992f-406d-8a64-f6e99f30916e\n\n[View all open jobs on GitHub](https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3A%22Help+Wanted%22)\n\n\n> **Applause Internal Information**\n> Exported by: Svetlana Lazutkina\n> Bug ID: 7160723\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: <a href=\"https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022057833046172939634\">https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022057833046172939634</a></li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2057833046172939634</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-05-29</li>\n<li>Automatic offers: </li>\n<ul>\n<li>MobileMage | Contributor | 111618931</li>\n</ul></li>\n    </ul>\n</details>\n\n<details><summary>Issue Owner</summary>Current Issue Owner: @mallenexpensify</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/91437/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/91437/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/93842","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/93842/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/93842/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/93842/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues/93842","id":4684634170,"node_id":"I_kwDOEQqHYc8AAAABFznYOg","number":93842,"title":"[$250] [Sentry: APP-9Y9] Android MountingCoordinator pullTransaction crash","user":{"login":"mountiny","id":36083550,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDgzNTUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36083550?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mountiny","html_url":"https://github.com/mountiny","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mountiny/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mountiny/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mountiny/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mountiny/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mountiny/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mountiny/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mountiny/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mountiny/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mountiny/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":fals