uthor_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"parent_issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/91302","issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Sentry\n\nhttps://expensify.sentry.io/issues/APP-9Y9\n\n## Impact (snapshot at filing)\n\n- Users (total since first seen): 27\n- Events: 45\n- Users (last 14d, 9.4.x releases): 9\n- First seen: 2026-04-11\n- Last seen: ongoing\n- Platform: iOS HybridApp\n- App version(s): 9.4.5–9.4.9\n- Affected route(s): unknown (Fabric mounting)\n- Mechanism: cpp_exception / native\n\n## Stack trace (top frames, first-party only)\n\n```\nfacebook::react::MountingCoordinator::pullTransaction\n```\n\n## Suspected cause\n\nReact Native Fabric mounting coordinator crash during transaction pull — needs native RN investigation.\n\n## Reproduction\n\nUnknown — see Sentry events linked from the Sentry issue.\n\n## Related\n\n- Prior GH issues: none\n\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: <a href=\"https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022067266240143914195\">https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022067266240143914195</a></li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2067266240143914195</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-07-01</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>\n\n<details><summary>Issue Owner</summary>Current Issue Owner: @linhvovan29546</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/93842/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/93842/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/93089","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensif