 on the Report field, select Remove from report - violations disappear\n5. Repeat step 4, select the existing report - violations are displayed\n6. Go offline, remove the first expense from the report again - violations disappear\n7. Go online\n\n## Expected Result:\n\"Potential duplicate\" violation is not displayed on the second expense, as the first one was removed from the report\n\n## Actual Result:\n\"Potential duplicate\" violation appears on the second expense online, when the first one was removed from the report offline\n\n## Workaround:\nUnknown\n\n## Platforms:\n- [ ] Android: App\n- [ ] Android: mWeb Chrome\n- [x] iOS: App\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Safari\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Chrome\n- [x] Windows: Chrome\n- [x] MacOS: Chrome Safari\n\n## Screenshots/Videos\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/af3e33d5-e2f9-4123-b462-bd0cbc8e5b5c\n\n[View all open jobs on GitHub](https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3A%22Help+Wanted%22)\n\n\n> **Applause Internal Information**\n> Exported by: Rizky Gunawan\n> Bug ID: 7190393\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: <a href=\"https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022070016297932142772\">https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022070016297932142772</a></li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2070016297932142772</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-07-02</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94533/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94533/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94341","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94341/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https: