Slack channel, fill out [this form](https://forms.gle/Q7hnhUJPnQCK7Fe56).\n___\n\n**Version Number:** 9.4.4-3\n**Reproducible in staging?:** Needs Reproduction (Reproduction blocked- Needs Amex credentials)\n**Reproducible in production?:** Needs Reproduction\n**If this was caught during regression testing, add the test name, ID and link from BrowserStack:**\n**Email or phone of affected tester (no customers):**\n**Logs:** https://stackoverflow.com/c/expensify/questions/4856\n**Expensify/Expensify Issue URL:**\n**Issue reported by:** @abbagail\n**Slack conversation** (hyperlinked to channel name): [#Expensify Bugs](https://expensify.slack.com/archives/C049HHMV9SM/p1781198478613109)\n\n## Action Performed:\n\nNewExpensify:\n1. Login into New Expensify\n2. Go to Workspace > [Workspace Name] > Company card\n3. Click \"assign Card.\"\n4. Get a prompt to sign in to AMEX\n5. Sign in and get directed back to Expensify\n\nClassic:\n1. Go to Settings > Domain > {Domain Name] > Company Card > AMEX\n2. Click \"Assign new Card.\"\n3. Follow the pop-up prompt to sign in\n4. Get directed back to Expensify\n\n## Expected Result:\nWhen directed back to Expensify, the connection is refreshed, and the user can assign the new card\n## Actual Result:\nND: When they click the card to assign, they're prompted to log back into AMEX again\nClassic: They're directed back to the domain, but only the \"Assign New Card\" shows for them\n\n## Workaround:\nUnknown\n## Platforms:\nSelect the officially supported platforms where the issue was reproduced:\n- [ ] Android: App\n- [ ] Android: mWeb Chrome\n- [ ] iOS: App\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Safari\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Chrome\n- [x] Windows: Chrome\n- [x] MacOS: Chrome / Safari\n\n## Screenshots/Videos\n\nThe screenshots for the issue are in Slack [thread](https://expensify.slack.com/archives/C049HHMV9SM/p1781198478613109)\n\n[View all open jobs on GitHub](https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3A%22Help+Wanted%22)\n\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: <a href=\"https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022065162815280794278\">https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022065162815280794278</a></li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2065162815280794278</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-07-02</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>\n\n<details><summary>Issue Owner</summary>Current Issue Owner: @youssef-lr</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/93328/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/93328/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/92097","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/92097/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/92097/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/92097/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues/92097","id":4549754136,"node_id":"I_kwDOEQqHYc8AAAABDy-9GA","number":92097,"title":"[$250] Per Diem expense does not appear in Expenses or Reports after creation in New Expensify","user":{"login":"m-natarajan","id":38435837,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NDM1ODM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38435837?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-natarajan","html_url":"https://github.com/m-natarajan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-natarajan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-natarajan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-natarajan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-natarajan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-natarajan/sub