/Pujan92/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pujan92/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pujan92/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pujan92/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"If you haven’t already, check out our [contributing guidelines](https://github.com/Expensify/ReactNativeChat/blob/main/contributingGuides/CONTRIBUTING.md) for onboarding and email contributors@expensify.com to request to join our Slack channel!\n___\n\n**Version Number:** 9.3.83-0\n**Reproducible in staging?:** Yes\n**Reproducible in production?:** Yes\n**If this was caught during regression testing, add the test name, ID and link from BrowserStack:** https://test-management.browserstack.com/projects/2219752/folder/13176702/test-cases/41236798\n**Email or phone of affected tester (no customers):** fischer9966+052626adm01@gmail.com\n**Issue reported by:** Applause Internal Team\n**Bug source:** Exploratory - Critical User Impact\n**Device used:** MacOS 26.5 / Safari, Chrome. iPhone 17 Pro / 26.5. Google Pixel 5 / Android 14\n**App Component:** Money Requests\n\n## Action Performed:\n1. Create Admin account with Gmail\n2. Create Collect workspace, set Workflows to enabled\n3. Enable Workflows > Delay submissions and set it to Manually\n4. Enable Approvals in Workflows and set Admin as Approver\n5. Enable Payments and connect bank account (eq Regions Bank, Savings account 1111)\n6. Invite Employee with Gmail accounts to this workspace\n7. Login as Employee and add bank account in the Wallet (eq Regions Bank, Checking account 0000)\n8. As employee submit an expense in the workspace\n9. Login as Admin\n10. Approve employee's payment from step 8\n11. Pay this payment with Bank account\n12. Open this expense, click More > Cancel payment\n\n## Expected Result:\nAdmin can successfully cancel а payment for an expensе of employee with a configured bank account in the wallet\n\n## Actual Result:\nAdmin receive error if cancel а payment for an expensе of employee with a configured bank account in the wallet. Admin can not cancel this payment.\n\n## Workaround:\nUnknown\n\n## Platforms:\n- [x] Android: App\n- [ ] Android: mWeb Chrome\n- [x] iOS: App\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Safari\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Chrome\n- [x] Windows: Chrome\n- [x] MacOS: Chrome Safari\n\n## Screenshots/Videos\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1f156e65-53a0-4711-83ca-09953eb942d6\n\n[View all open jobs on GitHub](https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3A%22Help+Wanted%22)\n\n\n> **Applause Internal Information**\n> Exported by: Julia Ponikarchuk\n> Bug ID: 7163894\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: <a href=\"https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022059555586462039722\">https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022059555586462039722</a></li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2059555586462039722</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-07-01</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/91804/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/91804/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/90140","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/90140/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/90140/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/90