 regression testing, add the test name, ID and link from BrowserStack:** https://test-management.browserstack.com/projects/2219752/folder/13176726/test-cases/41237088\n**Email or phone of affected tester (no customers):** lattelover1412+09054@gmail.com\n**Issue reported by:** Applause Internal Team\n**Bug source:** Regression TC Execution\n**Device used:** android\n**App Component:** Other\n\n## Action Performed:\nSetup - Can be executed in a Secondary device or browser\n1.  Log in as an admin of a workspace or create one\n2.  Click on the Invite Member button\n3. Add an email address that does not have an Expensify account >> set Admin Role\n4. Click Invite (Should be a real account with an inbox that can receive the invite)\n\nMain Device \n1. User is not logged in\n2. Open the email inbox of the invited user\n3. Click on the bottom link \"Open it in Expensify\"\n4. Verify that you are redirected to the workspace chat\n5. Tap back arrow (the top left) to return Home page\n\n## Expected Result:\nA blank page should not be displayed, and appropriate page with bottom button (Home, Account, Spend, etc) should be displayed after user tap back arrow\n\n## Actual Result:\nEndless loading with white blank page displayed, user is not able to proceed further steps. \nNote:  close the app and relaunch, user is able to open Home page\n\n## Workaround:\nUnknown\n\n## Platforms:\n- [x] Android: App\n- [ ] Android: mWeb Chrome\n- [ ] iOS: App\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Safari\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Chrome\n- [ ] Windows: Chrome\n- [ ] MacOS: Chrome / Safari\n\n## Screenshots/Videos\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/249d4eb2-56e6-4634-8b4c-0cb9c661042d\n\n[View all open jobs on GitHub](https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3A%22Help+Wanted%22)\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022053692491034956430</li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2053692491034956430</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-05-18</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>\n\n<details><summary>Issue Owner</summary>Current Issue Owner: @mallenexpensify</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/90140/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/90140/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/89903","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/89903/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/89903/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/89903/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues/89903","id":4398170476,"node_id":"I_kwDOEQqHYc8AAAABBibBbA","number":89903,"title":"[$250] [Exploratory] Trip - Trip room incorrectly created under default WS instead of the WS that travel enabled","user":{"login":"jponikarchuk","id":141990088,"node_id":"U_kgDOCHaYyA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141990088?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jponikarchuk","html_url":"https://github.com/jponikarchuk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jponikarchuk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jponikarchuk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jponikarchuk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jponikarchuk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jponikarchuk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jponikarchuk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jponikarchuk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jponikarchuk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"htt