nel!\n___\n\n**Version Number:** v9.3.68-1\n**Reproducible in staging?:** Yes\n**Reproducible in production?:** Yes\n**If this was caught during regression testing, add the test name, ID and link from BrowserStack:** https://test-management.browserstack.com/projects/2219752/test-runs/TR-26107/folder/13177079/41237919/1395679511\n**Email or phone of affected tester (no customers):** N/A\n**Issue reported by:** Applause Internal Team\n**Bug source:** Exploratory - Significant User Experience Deterioration\n**Device used:** Windows 11 / Chrome, Samsung Galaxy A52 / Android 14, iPhone 13 / iOS 26.5\n**App Component:** Money Requests\n\n## Action Performed:\nPreconditions\n- Logged in using expensifail account (it's recommended to use a new account\"\n- Create 2 workspaces, one workspace is set as the default (WS 1), and the second workspace is enabled with travel feature (WS 2)\n\nSteps:\n1. Navigate to WS 2 setting \n2. Click travel -> click \"manage expense\" -> fill all field using 548 Market for the address (if needed) and proceed until navigated to https://staging.travel.expensify.com\n3. Book a flight that set 1 month in the future and proceed until the flight booking is confirmed\n4. Navigate to ND\n5. Observe the trip room created\n\n## Expected Result:\nTrip room should be created under the workspace that enabling the travel feature\n\n## Actual Result:\nTrip room incorrectly created under default WS instead of the WS that travel enabled\n\n## Workaround:\nUnknown\n\n## Platforms:\n- [x] Android: App\n- [ ] Android: mWeb Chrome\n- [x] iOS: App\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Safari\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Chrome\n- [x] Windows: Chrome\n- [x] MacOS: Chrome / Safari\n\n## Screenshots/Videos\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7d65be24-2a05-475d-b662-c91442bc51c4\n\n[View all open jobs on GitHub](https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3A%22Help+Wanted%22)\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022054387159227806960</li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2054387159227806960</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-06-03</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>\n\n<details><summary>Issue Owner</summary>Current Issue Owner: @allgandalf</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/89903/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/89903/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"reopened","pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/92412","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/92412/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/92412/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/92412/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues/92412","id":4574194908,"node_id":"I_kwDOEQqHYc8AAAABEKSs3A","number":92412,"title":"[Due for payment 2026-07-07] [$250] [Sentry: APP-25V] HybridApp iOS EXC_BAD_ACCESS in RuntimeScheduler_Modern::runEventLoopTick","user":{"login":"mountiny","id":36083550,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDgzNTUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36083550?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mountiny","html_url":"https://github.com/mountiny","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mountiny/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mountiny/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mountiny/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mountiny/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mountiny/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mountiny/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mountiny/repo