 with user B on second device\n-  User A navigate to another conversation and lock the device.\n-  Wait for ~ 1 minute\n-  User B send a message to user A > Push notification appear on user A\n\n1.  After about 10 seconds, user A on main device disable the internet connection.\n2. Tap on the push notification\n3. Find the new message\n\n## Expected Result:\nIt should navigate the user to the correct chat, and the new message should be available.\n\n## Actual Result:\nIt navigate user to the correct chat but the new message isn't shown\n\n## Workaround:\nUnknown\n\n## Platforms:\n- [ ] Android: App\n- [ ] Android: mWeb Chrome\n- [x] iOS: App\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Safari\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Chrome\n- [ ] Windows: Chrome\n- [ ] MacOS: Chrome Safari\n\n## Screenshots/Videos\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c1afa1b8-3cba-4f26-9790-28ff21780271\n\n[View all open jobs on GitHub](https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3A%22Help+Wanted%22)\n\n\n> **Applause Internal Information**\n> Exported by: Nathan Lemma\n> Bug ID: 7185858\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: <a href=\"https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022068993927120961202\">https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022068993927120961202</a></li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2068993927120961202</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-07-06</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94150/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94150/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94214","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94214/labels{/name}","comments_url":"ht