ce.\nCompany card transactions are no longer retained under the group workspace.\n\n## Workaround:\nUnknown\n## Platforms:\nSelect the officially supported platforms where the issue was reproduced:\n- [ ] Android: App\n- [ ] Android: mWeb Chrome\n- [ ] iOS: App\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Safari\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Chrome\n- [x] Windows: Chrome\n- [x] MacOS: Chrome / Safari\n\n## Screenshots/Videos\n\n\n[View all open jobs on GitHub](https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3A%22Help+Wanted%22)\n\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: <a href=\"https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022070242893707980909\">https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022070242893707980909</a></li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2070242893707980909</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-07-02</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>\n\n<details><summary>Issue Owner</summary>Current Issue Owner: @yusufdeveloper2903</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94622/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94622/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/91560","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/91560/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/91560/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/91560/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues/91560","id":4514219956,"node_id":"I_kwDOEQqHYc8AAAABDRGHtA","number":91560,"title":"[$250] Chat  - Whisper message disappears after mentioning second user","user":{"login":"applause-bot[bot]","id":265651874,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOD9WGog","avatar_url":"https://avatars.gi