"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"If you haven’t already, check out our [contributing guidelines](https://github.com/Expensify/ReactNativeChat/blob/main/contributingGuides/CONTRIBUTING.md) for onboarding and email contributors@expensify.com to request to join our Slack channel!\n___\n\n**Version Number:** v9.3.80-0\n**Reproducible in staging?:** Yes\n**Reproducible in production?:** Yes\n**If this was caught during regression testing, add the test name, ID and link from BrowserStack:** https://test-management.browserstack.com/projects/2219752/folder/13176685/test-cases/41236620\n**Email or phone of affected tester (no customers):** htad26+gbnd@gmail.com\n**Issue reported by:** Applause Internal Team\n**Bug source:** Regression TC Execution\n**Device used:** Windows 10 / Chrome, iOS 26.3 / iPhone 13\n**App Component:** Chat Report View\n\n## Action Performed:\n1. Create a Public Room if needed\n2. Mention a user who is not a member of the room\n3. Send another mention of a different user that is not part of the room\n\n## Expected Result:\nThe system message for the first mention and for the second mention exists\n\n## Actual Result:\nThe whisper message for the first mention disappears\n\n## Workaround:\nUnknown\n\n## Platforms:\n- [x] Android: App\n- [ ] Android: mWeb Chrome\n- [x] iOS: App\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Safari\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Chrome\n- [x] Windows: Chrome\n- [x] MacOS: Chrome Safari\n\n## Screenshots/Videos\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5c73de31-151b-4bf3-b843-fde350454087\n\n[View all open jobs on GitHub](https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3A%22Help+Wanted%22)\n\n\n> **Applause Internal Information**\n> Exported by: Mita Rachim\n> Bug ID: 7161149\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: <a href=\"https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022058766420823684467\">https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022058766420823684467</a></li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2058766420823684467</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-06-01</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>\n\n\n\n<details><summary>Issue Owner</summary>Current Issue Owner: @akinwale</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/91560/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/91560/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/92246","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/92246/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/92246/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/92246/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues/92246","id":4564165154,"node_id":"I_kwDOEQqHYc8AAAABEAuiIg","number":92246,"title":"[$250] Expense - Rejected expense is not moved to selfDM when submission frequency is disabled","user":{"login":"applause-bot[bot]","id":265651874,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOD9WGog","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/3009811?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/applause-bot%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/applause-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/applause-bot%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/applause-bot%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/applause-bot%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/applause-bot%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/applause-bot%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/applause-bot%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/applause-bot%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https