Krishna2323/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krishna2323/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krishna2323/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krishna2323/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"If you haven’t already, check out our [contributing guidelines](https://github.com/Expensify/ReactNativeChat/blob/main/contributingGuides/CONTRIBUTING.md) for onboarding and email contributors@expensify.com to request to join our Slack channel!\n___\n\n**Version Number:** v9.3.90-1\n**Reproducible in staging?:** Yes\n**Reproducible in production?:** Yes\n**If this was caught during regression testing, add the test name, ID and link from BrowserStack:** https://test-management.browserstack.com/projects/2219752/test-runs/TR-35861/folder/13176744/55971987/1449112331?sort=%2Bidentifier\n**Email or phone of affected tester (no customers):** n/a\n**Issue reported by:** Applause Internal Team\n**Bug source:** Regression TC Execution\n**Device used:** Mac 15.4.1 Safari/Chrome, iPhone 13 iOS 26.5\n**App Component:** Money Requests\n\n## Action Performed:\nPreconditions:The user is logged into an account with Admin privileges for an active workspace.\nSubmission frequency disabled in Workflows settings.\nThe workspace has Distance Tracking enabled and a default distance rate configured.\n\n1. Go to https://staging.new.expensify.com\n2. Navigate to the workspace chat\n3. Create a distance expense in the workspace chat \n4. Open the expense report\n5. Click \"Submit\" on the report header\n6. Click More  >  Reject\n7. Enter a reason for rejection and click \"Reject expense\"\n\n## Expected Result:\nWhen submission frequency is disabled, the rejected expense should be moved to selfDM, LHN should clearly display the associated distance rate\n\n## Actual Result:\nRejected expense is not moved to selfDM when submission frequency is disabled\n\n## Workaround:\nUnknown\n\n## Platforms:\n- [ ] Android: App\n- [ ] Android: mWeb Chrome\n- [x] iOS: App\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Safari\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Chrome\n- [x] Windows: Chrome\n- [x] MacOS: Chrome Safari\n\n## Screenshots/Videos\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cd9f16d9-d240-427d-b2e8-904bc425b29c\n\n[View all open jobs on GitHub](https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3A%22Help+Wanted%22)\n\n\n> **Applause Internal Information**\n> Exported by: Julia Ponikarchuk\n> Bug ID: 7166620\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: <a href=\"https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022061466533218948128\">https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022061466533218948128</a></li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2061466533218948128</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-07-06</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>\n\n<details><summary>Issue Owner</summary>Current Issue Owner: @neil-marcellini</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/92246/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/92246/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/398","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/398/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/398/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/398/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/398","id":3974807149,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87s6r5t","number":398,"title":"[QUEST] Harden the Chain — Security Quest, 67 RTC Total","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":65,"created_at":"2026-02-22T15:25:06Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T19:04:22Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Quest Chain: Harden the Chain\n\nFor security-minded contributors. Complete each step to earn up to **100 RTC** and the **Guardian** title.\n\n---\n\n### Step 1: Read the Architecture (10 RTC)\nRead the codebase and write a 500+ word security assessment covering:\n- How attestation works (the \\`/attest/submit\\` flow)\n- How hardware fingerprinting prevents VM farms\n- How epoch rewards are calculated and distributed\n- One potential attack vector you identified\n\n**Prove it:** Post your assessment as a comment or gist link.\n\n---\n\n### Step 2: Reproduce a Known Fix (15 RTC)\nPick one vulnerability from BuilderFred's audit (all 6 are fixed):\n1. VM Fingerprint Bypass\n2. Antiquity Spoofing\n3. Mock Signature Mode\n4. Inline PubKey Hijack\n5. SQL Schema Mismatch\n6. Hardware Binding Bypass\n\nSet up a local test environment and demonstrate you understand HOW the fix works by:\n- Describing the attack before the fix\n- Showing the fix in the code\n- Explaining why the fix is sufficient (or isn't)\n\n**Prove it:** Write-up with code references.\n\n---\n\n### Step 3: Find Something New (75 RTC)\nFind and report a previously unknown security issue. Must include:\n- Clear description of the vulnerability\n- Steps to reproduce\n- Severity assessment (Critical/High/Medium/Low)\n- Suggested fix\n\n**Prove it:** File a responsible disclosure via the SECURITY.md process. If confirmed, earn the full 75 RTC + Guardian title.\n\n---\n\n### Completion\n\n| Steps | Reward | Title |\n|-------|--------|-------|\n| Step 1 only | 10 RTC | Security Explorer |\n| Steps 1 + 2 | 25 RTC | Security Analyst |\n| Steps 1 + 2 + 3 | **100 RTC** | **Guardian** |\n\n*You don't have to find a new vulnerability to earn from Steps 1 and 2. Those reward understanding, not just discovery.*","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/398/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":1,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/398/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asyncapi/website/issues/3186","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asyncapi/website","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asyncapi/website/issues/3186/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asyncapi/website/issues/3186/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asyncapi/website/issues/3186/events","html_url":"https://github.com/asyncapi/website/issues/3186","id":2501479656,"node_id":"I_kwDOBW5R_c6VGYzo","number":3186,"title":"[FEATURE] Performance + Accessibility Improvement of website","user":{"login":"akshatnema","id":76521428,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NTIxNDI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76521428?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akshatnema","html_url":"https://github.com/akshatnema","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akshatnema/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akshatnema/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akshatnema/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akshatnema/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akshatnema/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akshatnema/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akshatnema/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akshatnema/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akshatnema/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":603919132,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw2MDM5MTkxMzI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asyncapi/website/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"84b6eb","default":true,"description":null},{"id":1907431320,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxOTA3NDMxMzIw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asyncapi/website/labels/Epic","name":"Epic","color":"3E4B9E","default":false,"description":null},{"id":5407684713,"node_id":"LA_kwDOBW5R_c8AAAABQlK4aQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asyncapi/website/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0e8a16","default":false,"description":"AsyncAPI Bounty program related label"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[{"login":"patilpratik1905","id":153302730,"node_id":"U_kgDOCSM2yg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/153302730?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905","html_url":"https://github.com/patilpratik1905","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":53,"created_at":"2024-09-02T19:07:32Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T18:30:54Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":{"login":"patilpratik1905","id":153302730,"node_id":"U_kgDOCSM2yg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/153302730?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905","html_url":"https://github.com/patilpratik1905","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Why do we need this improvement?\n\nWith the addition of multiple components, pages and MD files, it's now important for us, to make the website efficient for all web + mobile users. Currently, the performance of the website has critically low numbers in both web and mobile view, which can impact the efficiency and user views in the website. \r\n\r\nOn the other hand, it's also important that we add the necessary accessibility labels to the website. Currently, with the addition of many new illustrations, we have not added label elements for these tags.\n\n### How will this change help?\n\nThe performance improvement will help the website render the contents more efficiently to the users and will drastically enhance lighthouse key metrics.\n\n### Screenshots\n\nSome screenshots of lighthouse reports:\r\n<img width=\"638\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/acfee5f2-bdf5-477e-92c9-92ee585ef731\">\r\n\r\n\n\n### How could it be implemented/designed?\n\nFollowing tasks need to be done in this issue:\r\n\r\n- [ ] Make proper research + analysis on what needs to be fixed to improve performance in both mobile + web view.\r\n- [ ] Propose the solution to improve the performance of website, at least 95% on each page.\r\n- [ ] Search for the elements that require labels to improve accessibility.\r\n- [ ] Create a workflow to analyse lighthouse reports for each page (not docs, blogs or any mdx rendered page0\n\n### 🚧 Breaking changes\n\nYes\n\n### 👀 Have you checked for similar open issues?\n\n- [X] I checked and didn't find a similar issue\n\n### 🏢 Have you read the Contributing Guidelines?\n\n- [X] I have read the [Contributing Guidelines](https://github.com/asyncapi/.github/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n\n### Are you willing to work on this issue?\n\nNone","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asyncapi/website/issues/3186/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asyncapi/website/issues/3186/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/70485","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/70485/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/70485/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/70485/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues/70485","id":3411078388,"node_id":"I_kwDOEQqHYc7LUOz0","number":70485,"title":"[$250] Update system messages for expenses moved to different reports","user":{"login":"garrettmknight","id":1529980,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1Mjk5ODA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1529980?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/garrettmknight","html_url":"https://github.com/garrettmknight","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garrettmknight/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garrettmknight/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garrettmknight/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garrettmknight/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garrettmknight/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garrettmknight