/jasperhuangg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasperhuangg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasperhuangg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasperhuangg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasperhuangg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasperhuangg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasperhuangg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"If you haven’t already, check out our [contributing guidelines](https://github.com/Expensify/ReactNativeChat/blob/main/contributingGuides/CONTRIBUTING.md) for onboarding and email contributors@expensify.com to request to join our Slack channel!\n___\n\n**Version Number:** 9.3.24-1\n**Reproducible in staging?:** Yes\n**Reproducible in production?:** Yes\n**If this was caught during regression testing, add the test name, ID and link from BrowserStack:** https://github.com/Expensify/App/pull/71244\n**Email or phone of affected tester (no customers):** sdjoisjdosnijjsondijdso@gmail.com\n**Issue reported by:** Applause Internal Team\n**Bug source:** Exploratory - Significant User Experience Deterioration\n**Device used:** Mac 26.2 / Chrome\n**App Component:** Money Requests\n\n## Action Performed:\nPrecondition:\n- Taxes are enabled.\n\n1. Go to staging.new.expensify.com\n2. Go to workspace chat.\n3. Create an expense with 0% tax rate.\n4. Create another expense with 5% tax rate.\n5. Open any expense.\n6. Click Tax field.\n→ Tax field show tax rate name and it is selected in the list.\n7. Go to workspace settings > Taxes.\n8. Click 0% rate > Tax code.\n9. Upgrade the workspace.\n10. Edit tax code and save it.\n11. Repeat Step 8 and 10 with 5% rate.\n12. Open any expense from Step 3 or 4.\n13. Click Tax field.\n→ Tax field is not showing tax rate name. Tax is no longer selected in the list.\n14. Go back to expense report.\n15. Select both expenses via checkbox > click dropdown button > Merge.\n→ Tax rate section is also missing tax rate name and it is showing only tax percentage.\n\n## Expected Result:\nIn Step 13 and 15, after editing tax code, Tax name will not disappear and tax will remain selected.\n\n## Actual Result:\nAfter changing tax code,\n- in Step 13, Tax field is not showing tax rate name. Tax is no longer selected in the list.\n- in Step 15, Tax rate section is also missing tax rate name and it is showing only tax percentage.\n\n## Workaround:\nUnknown\n\n## Platforms:\n- [x] Android: App\n- [ ] Android: mWeb Chrome\n- [x] iOS: App\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Safari\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Chrome\n- [x] Windows: Chrome\n- [ ] MacOS: Chrome / Safari\n\n## Screenshots/Videos\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/68a79142-7675-499a-b232-41e38c2db3c7\n\n[View all open jobs on GitHub](https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3A%22Help+Wanted%22)\n\n\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022024978932059523878</li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2024978932059523878</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-03-02</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/83111/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/83111/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"reopened","pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/93772","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App","labels_url":"htt