ink. 3 RTC if confirmed valid.\n\n**Reward**: 3 RTC (~$0.30) | **Multi-claim**","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/520/reactions","total_count":7,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":1,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/520/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94411","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94411/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94411/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94411/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues/94411","id":4732157974,"node_id":"I_kwDOEQqHYc8AAAABGg8AFg","number":94411,"title":"[$250] Scan - Navigating to thread via \"Explain\" link on failed scan expense, shows skeleton loader","user":{"login":"applause-bot[bot]","id":265651874,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOD9WGog","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/3009811?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/applause-bot%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/applause-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/applause-bot%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/applause-bot%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/applause-bot%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/applause-bot%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/applause-bot%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/applause-bot%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/applause-bot%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/applause-bot%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","