rs/mollfpr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mollfpr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mollfpr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mollfpr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"If you haven’t already, check out our [contributing guidelines](https://github.com/Expensify/ReactNativeChat/blob/main/contributingGuides/CONTRIBUTING.md) for onboarding and email contributors@expensify.com to request to join our Slack channel!\n___\n\n**Version Number:** 9.4.18-0\n**Reproducible in staging?:** Yes\n**Reproducible in production?:** No\n**If this was caught during regression testing, add the test name, ID and link from BrowserStack:** https://github.com/Expensify/App/pull/93532\n**Email or phone of affected tester (no customers):** ibellicotest+2766@gmail.com\n**Issue reported by:** Applause Internal Team\n**Bug source:** Exploratory - Significant User Experience Deterioration\n**Device used:** Motorola MotoG60 / Android 12 (Hybrid app) - Windows 11 / Chrome\n**App Component:** Money Requests\n\n## Action Performed:\nPrerequisite: Account has at least one workspace.\n1. Open the Expensify app.\n2. Tap on FAB > \"Create Expense\" > \"Scan\"\n3. Create a scan expense with a receipt that will trigger a failure and submit it to workspace chat.\n4. Open the just created expense.\n5. Wait until receiving a Concierge message showing the scanning failure.\n6. Tap on \"Explain\" at the end of that message,\n7. Note that you land on a thread, and that skeleton loader is displayed for some time before messages are visible.\n\n## Expected Result:\nAfter tapping on \"Explain\" on Concierge message after scan failure, user should land on a new created thread that should automatically load.\n\n## Actual Result:\nSkeleton loader is displayed for some time when user navigates to thread after tapping on \"Explain\" link on Concierge message after scan expense failure.\n\n## Workaround:\nUnknown\n\n## Platforms:\n- [x] Android: App\n- [ ] Android: mWeb Chrome\n- [ ] iOS: App\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Safari\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Chrome\n- [x] Windows: Chrome\n- [ ] MacOS: Chrome Safari\n\n## Screenshots/Videos\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c80c7b96-a269-4455-8568-95ea751d6646\n\n[View all open jobs on GitHub](https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3A%22Help+Wanted%22)\n\n\n> **Applause Internal Information**\n> Exported by: Julia Ponikarchuk\n> Bug ID: 7189308\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: <a href=\"https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022071452525536444275\">https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022071452525536444275</a></li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2071452525536444275</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-07-06</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94411/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94411/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0}],"search_type":"lexical"}